# =============================================================================
# Env file map for this project
# =============================================================================
#
# Backend (Express / Render):
#   Copy server/.env.example → server/.env
#   On Render Dashboard, add the same keys (Root Directory = server)
#
# Frontend (static / Vercel):
#   Copy client/.env.example → client/.env
#   Set API_BASE_URL to your Render URL ending in /api
#   Run: npm run sync:config
#   Deploy folder: public  (Vercel Root Directory = public)
#
# CLIENT_URL is a BACKEND variable (bill links), not a frontend .env key.
# =============================================================================
